      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Personally this is a great idea, but there needs to be a public api system vrchat can link to to stream the content. Rabb.it have kept their api from my knowledge close source, id totally agree with this but its just no way unless a public api is made):",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-29T21:43:38.676Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Imagine trying to do a VR movie night, but you have to dig around YouTube for some bootlegged version of a movie and it makes the whole situation a pain. Even if you were to include a way for Netflix links to work in game, you'd still have to get up, paste in the new link for every episode and then sometimes the videos won't load for everyone.\n\nIf there was a way to put in a Rabb.it stream into the in-game video players it would solve this issue and allow for great show binging sessions or movie nights with your friends!",
